''               25 Sep 2026 -- SRC_REV=43, FMT 27: task 3610 (R19.4 1e, DRIVER_REV 21). The START part arms the driver's
''               winding check (steering.testSetWindingProbe(TRUE)) before the start: lifetimes 0 .. SK_WIND_LIVES-1 of
''               the dual-start build, and every lifetime of the START_NEG_PHASE build, beside its withheld LEFT phase.
''               After skReadHealth() each wheel's three pairs (U->V, V->W, W->U) are read, and each armed lifetime prints
''               a new BM-SKWIND per wheel. New cells R19-DUAL-WINDR-X and R19-DUAL-WINDSPR-X per wheel (dual-start only)
''               and R19-DUAL-WINDNEG-X, LEFT (START_NEG_PHASE only). The ABI dump's parameter run is 25 longs (probe_sink,
