''               25 Sep 2026 -- SRC_REV=44, FMT 28: PL-120, the 2026-09-24 21:21 recurrence (task 3613). Part FAULTRESP
''               dumps a trial's driver runs (BM-ABI* where,NOMOTION) once FR_NOMOTION_MS of commanded drive has passed
