''               the run's first FLTRESP trial that ends STEADY_TIMEOUT, a recovery probe on that wheel: up to
''               FR_RECOVER_TRIES fresh lifetimes, one every FR_RECOVER_GAP_MS from the failure, each driving
''               FR_RECOVER_INCRE for FR_RECOVER_DRIVE_MS, ending at the first that moves. New records BM-FRRECOV (one
''               per try), BM-FRRECSUM (once, after FLTRESP's trials, probed or not) and BM-FRDIAG (a header record: the
''               new constants and the build's wheel order, since BM-FRBUILD has no room under 280 bytes). -D
