''               25 Sep 2026 -- SRC_REV=47, FMT 31: PL-137 (task 3610, Visit 10 pass 4 sec 5; DRIVER_REV 24). The wiring walk
''               failed a healthy left wheel once, and its cause is not established, so the driver now keeps each leg's own
