''               gains R20-PACK-WINDV per motor. WD_WIND_MS includes that reading. Five why tokens and one event stage
''               (PACK) are appended. No other record changes
''               26 Sep 2026 -- SRC_REV=49, FMT 33: Visit 10 pass 5 (task 3613). PL-120 struck twice after driving and
