''               the next dead bridge records its own per-phase signature. DRIVER_REV 26 (PL-137's fix: the steering path
''               limiter stays out of a wiring walk). Part START also prints BM-FRONTST after each walk (PL-140: its
''               LATE_PASS events are placed against the front cog's own counts). No other record changes
''               26 Sep 2026 -- SRC_REV=50: PL-141 (task 3622, DRIVER_REV 28). The steering path limiter now engages only
